OL,3,GNEWSAHope crematorium work will stop
OL,4,Afuneral disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork costing #1m is needed at a
OL,7,Fcrematorium to avoid disruption to
OL,8,Ffunerals in the future, a council
OL,9,Freport said.
OL,11,FTeesside Crematorium in Middlesbrough
OL,12,Fcurrently operates three cremators
OL,13,Fthrough a single abatement plant - the
OL,14,Fsystem needed to clean gases before
OL,15,Fthey are released.
OL,17,FA report by the council's director of
OL,18,Fenvironment, Geoff Field, said if that
OL,19,Ffailed it "could severely restrict the
OL,20,Fcouncil's ability to undertake
OL,21,Fcremations on site".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
