OL,3,GNEWSAHope crematorium work will stop
OL,4,Afuneral disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "In the event of a major plant
OL,7,Ffailure, cremation services could be
OL,8,Fseverely restricted or temporarily
OL,9,Fsuspended, potentially resulting in
OL,10,Ffuneral delays and significant distress
OL,11,Ffor bereaved families."
